### Current User 
# @name current user
POST {{EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL}}/current-user
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: accessToken {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Registration Status
# @name registrationStatus
POST {{EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL}}/get_registration_status/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: accessToken {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

