### Create Pensioner
# @name createPensioner
POST {{EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL}}/api/create_pensioner/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: accessToken {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

{ 
  "ppo_no": {{PPO_NO}},
  "dob": "",
  "bank_account_number": "",
  "password": ""
}

