### Verification
# @name verification
POST {{EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL}}/api/verification/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: accessToken {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json


### DLC
# @name dlc
POST {{EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL}}/api/lc/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: accessToken {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

{ 
  "selfVerNec": "",
  "selfVerNmc": "",
  "device": "",
  "device_id": "",
  "ver_mode_code": "",
  "self_ver_code": "",
  "place": ""
}


