### Change Password
# @name changePassword
POST {{EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL}}/api/change_password/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: accessToken {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

{ 
  "oldPassword":"",
  "newPassword":"",
}

### Validate Token
# @name validateToken
POST {{EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL}}/api/validate_token/
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Authorization: renewToken {{renewToken}},
Accept: 'application/json',

{ 
  "uid":"",
  "request_token":""
}


### Manual
# @name manual
GET {{EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL}}/manual.html
Authorization: accessToken {{accessToken}}

